    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 25.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe of ðissa gerædnesse gá, gilde æt frumcirre V pund, æt oþrum cirre his wer, æt þriddan cirre þolige ealles þæs he age ⁊ ure ealra freondscipes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who violates these ordinances shall, on the first occasion, pay 5 pounds; on the second occasion, his wergeld; and on the third he shall lose all that he has, and the friendship of us all.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe of ðis gerednysse gá, gylde æt frumcyrre V punde, æt oþrum cyrre his wer, æt ðriddan ðolige ealle ðæs ðe he age ⁊ ura ealra freondscipes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
